-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"constraints":"Recommendations are suggestions; save only the person-selected catalog IDs. completed means person finished setup, not that every optional pack is installed.","options":["save","leave"],"question":"Accept the recommended setup or keep current choices?"},"key":"setup-choices","section":"judge"}
J setup-choices save|leave:"Accept the recommended setup or keep current choices?" -- Recommendations are suggestions; save only the person-selected catalog IDs. completed means person finished setup, not that every optional pack is installed.
V J setup-choices -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
