J pack-download install|leave:"Stage this separately packaged add-on?" -- Read pack availability first; unavailable/no manifest is a stop. Staging does not activate anything. Remote downloads require chosen scope, signed manifest and size within authorized budget.
V J pack-download -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
